- [Metrics JSON](/home/quant/dev/quant/quant-research/run_log/one_bar_nq_stop_scaling_20261012/risk_comparison_20261012/metrics.json) · [Monte Carlo JSON](/home/quant/dev/quant/quant-research/run_log/one_bar_nq_stop_scaling_20261012/risk_comparison_20261012/monte_carlo.json) · [Metrics CSV](/home/quant/dev/quant/quant-research/run_log/one_bar_nq_stop_scaling_20261012/risk_comparison_20261012/metrics.csv)

The focused tests passed (3 passed), `git diff --check` passed, and the frozen package inventory and archive hash still match.

